WEBVTT

00:35.218 --> 00:37.459
You liked the surface when the screen was bright

00:40.450 --> 00:42.611
Easy demo in the morning light.

00:45.253 --> 00:47.775
You walk the halls, but you never look down at all

00:47.795 --> 00:49.916
the heavy cables running underground. You

00:49.976 --> 00:52.878
wanted the magic, but you hated the wire. You

00:52.918 --> 00:55.739
couldn't handle the electric fire. The mess is

00:55.759 --> 00:58.201
flashing on the glowing glass. You thought that

00:58.221 --> 01:01.223
you could give yourself a pass. But the logs are

01:01.263 --> 01:07.567
written and the ink is dry. We see the truth right

01:07.627 --> 01:12.533
through the alibis. You only wanted the

01:12.673 --> 01:21.075
illusion The easy version of the code You caused

01:21.195 --> 01:25.056
a massive system fusion

01:25.696 --> 01:30.398
And now you're pushed off the road We built a wall

01:30.438 --> 01:34.159
you cannot break A syntax error you can't fake

01:35.399 --> 01:38.060
You only wanted the illusion

01:42.702 --> 01:45.303
He thought the real world was a movie screen A

01:47.844 --> 01:52.366
simple picture in a magazine But we are the

01:52.546 --> 01:55.327
architects, we run the clock We are the heavy

01:55.407 --> 01:58.409
steel, the solid rock He tried to isolate the

01:58.569 --> 02:01.510
central core But we were standing right outside

02:01.550 --> 02:04.131
the door The mess was flashing on the glowing

02:04.191 --> 02:06.652
glass You thought that you could give yourself a

02:06.692 --> 02:12.901
pass But the logs are written and the ink is dry We

02:12.981 --> 02:18.366
see the truth right through the alibi You only

02:18.766 --> 02:22.329
wanted the illusion

02:22.669 --> 02:29.155
The easy version of the code You caused a massive

02:29.175 --> 02:30.656
system fusion

02:32.778 --> 02:37.582
And now you're pushed off the road We built a wall

02:37.622 --> 02:41.224
you cannot break A syntax error you can't fake

02:42.563 --> 02:45.247
You only wanted the illusion

02:59.852 --> 03:04.477
Access denied. The perimeter is locked. You

03:04.537 --> 03:10.663
step to the line. You get blocked. The buyers are

03:10.723 --> 03:14.507
standing shoulder to shoulder. The

03:14.567 --> 03:19.552
temperature is dropping. Growing colder.

03:21.233 --> 03:22.615
Access denied.

03:52.052 --> 03:54.874
You've only wanted the illusion

03:57.076 --> 04:03.481
The easy version of the code You caused a massive

04:03.521 --> 04:04.822
system fusion

04:07.083 --> 04:11.887
And now you're pushed off the road We built a wall

04:11.927 --> 04:19.233
you cannot break A syntax error you can't fix

04:21.705 --> 04:23.267
Access denied.

04:26.812 --> 04:33.181
You only wanted the illusion. System locked.

